    1. value_per_resource_consumed / resource_types aggregation
       Q: How should energy_kWh, raw_materials_kg, and operator_labor_hours be combined into a single denominator — do you have explicit monetary conversion rates (e.g. €0.15/kWh, €2.00/kg, €25/hr) or should they be equally normalised, since without weights the optimiser can exploit whichever resource appears cheapest to achieve a better ratio?
