    4. operator_fatigue_index / constraint safety margin
       Q: Should the optimiser target a fatigue index strictly below the 0.4 hard ceiling (e.g. a working target of ≤ 0.35 to absorb sensor noise and late-cycle spikes), or is 0.40 the exact operating point at which the optimiser should stop rather than a practical upper bound?
