    5. shift_duration / early termination eligibility
       Q: The shift_duration constraint only sets an upper bound of 8 hours — can the optimiser recommend ending the shift early (e.g. at hour 6) if value_per_resource_consumed is maximised at that point and fatigue is rising toward 0.4, or is a minimum shift duration contractually or operationally required?
